A typed container writes each class once

```
{.calculation}
::: calculation
42
:::
.
<div class="calculation">
  <p>42</p>
</div>
```

```
{.note}
::: note
42
:::
.
<aside class="admonition note" aria-label="Note">
  <p>42</p>
</aside>
```

```
{.admonition}
::: note
42
:::
.
<aside class="admonition note" aria-label="Note">
  <p>42</p>
</aside>
```

```
{.x .note .y}
::: note
42
:::
.
<aside class="admonition note x y" aria-label="Note">
  <p>42</p>
</aside>
```
